ss 官方仓库下架且不再维护。检查 wp-content/uploads/gform_aviary/ 目录下是否存在可疑 PHP 文件，如有则删除。作为替代方案，可选用其他受支持的 WordPress 图片编辑插件（如 Classic Editor + 媒体库自带编辑功能）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132256/WordPress-Aviary-Image-Editor-Add-On-For-Gravity-Forms-3.0-Beta-Shell-Upload.html","http://www.vapid.dhs.org/advisory.php?v=125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37275","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4455.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4455","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4455-7d9a49758ec4a0e1bba306ea632621c1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4455_1.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-4455.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4455.rules","https://github.com/strawberri3s/DotBot/blob/842d191dd290f8ca041ec3c5897bb16e13ee1eea/CVE_2015_4455_gravityformsindex.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0037.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0020","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2794","title":"DotNetNuke 安装向导权限绕过漏洞","description":"DotNetNuke（DNN）在 7.4.1 之前版本中存在安全绕过漏洞，安装向导页面 Install/InstallWizard.aspx 在系统完成初始安装后未正确移除或设置访问权限，导致远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可直接访问该页面并重新执行安装流程。攻击者通过向目标发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，在安装过程中创建新的 SuperUser 管理员账户，从而完全控制整个 DNN 站点。该漏洞影响所有 7.4.1 之前版本的 DotNetNuke 部署，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2794"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-02-06T15:59:00.137","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:46.163","remediation":"立即升级 DotNetNuke 至 7.4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复安装向导未授权访问问题。如无法立即升级，删除或重命名 Install 目录下的 InstallWizard.aspx 文件，或在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面限制对 /Install/InstallWizard.aspx 路径的访问，仅允许管理员 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community-blog/cid/155198/workaround-for-potential-security-issue","http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community/security/security-center","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96373","https://dotnetnuke.codeplex.com/releases/view/615317","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39777/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39777","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2794.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-2794.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2794/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2015-2794-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2794_1.yaml","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2015/database/CVE-2015-2015/DNN_CVE-2015-2794-styx00.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/13e17ac40c12fcaa921f27e9c8534f670bd0f2c1/plugins/dotnetnuke/dotnetnuke/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2015/CVE-2015-2794/README.md","https://github.com/styx00/DNN_CVE-2015-2794","https://github.com/wilsc0w/CVE-2015-2794-finder"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0016","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2080","title":"Eclipse Jetty 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Eclipse Jetty 在 9.2.9.v20150224 之前版本的异常处理代码中存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（JetLeak）。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送包含非法字符的 HTTP 请求头，即可触发异常处理流程中的缓冲区错误，导致进程内存中的敏感数据（如会话令牌、密钥、其他用户请求数据等）被泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Jetty 的 Web 应用服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求头实现远程信息窃取，无需任何前置权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2080"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-07T14:59:00.193","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:33.857","remediation":"升级 Eclipse Jetty 至 9.2.9.v20150224 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含非法字符（如 0x0 等控制字符）的 HTTP 请求头，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://dev.eclipse.org/mhonarc/lists/jetty-announce/msg00074.html","http://dev.eclipse.org/mhonarc/lists/jetty-announce/msg00075.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-March/151804.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130567/Jetty-9.2.8-Shared-Buffer-Leakage.ht