2015-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0006","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000012","title":"WordPress mypixs插件本地文件包含漏洞","description":"WordPress mypixs 插件 v0.3 存在本地文件包含漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用插件对文件路径过滤不严的缺陷，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd、wp-config.php 等敏感文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级插件或禁用该插件以修复漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000012"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:13.537","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:16.303","remediation":"立即卸载并删除 mypixs 插件（该插件已于 2007 年关闭下架，不再维护且无安全更新）。如暂时无法删除，可在 .htaccess 中添加 RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/mypixs/ - [F,L] 阻止对插件目录的全部访问，或将 wp-content/plugins/mypixs/ 目录重命名以禁用插件功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94495","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=154","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-1000012/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-1000012.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000012_1_3.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-1000012_1.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2015-1000012.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000012-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/foreztgump/cve_json/blob/064c5994dc5b0dca3ff5c1366813b79a53b8356d/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-1000012-mypixs-5413ae2a-9afa-4ff6-b241-73b446881185.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0005","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000010","title":"WordPress simple-image-manipulator 插件远程文件下载漏洞","description":"WordPress simple-image-manipulator 插件 1.0 版本存在访问控制缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用插件中缺乏权限校验的文件下载功能，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 wp-config.php 等敏感配置文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 simple-image-manipulator 插件的所有版本，攻击无需用户交互，利用难度低，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000010"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:11.257","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:16.093","remediation":"立即从 WordPress 站点删除 simple-image-manipulator 插件（该插件已于 2013 年关闭且不再维护），在 wp-content/plugins/ 目录下删除 simple-image-manipulator 文件夹。如暂时无法删除，可在 .htaccess 中添加规则阻止对 /wp-content/plugins/simple-image-manipulator/controller/download.php 的访问：`RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/simple-image-manipulator/ - [F,L]`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94563","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=147","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2015/1000xxx/CVE-2015-1000010.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000010_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-1000010-68af99e3772493c2869a6daa59ed7782.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2015-1000010.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000010-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/IDEA-Research-Group/AMADEUS/blob/ab685deeb710b4b3f39b52a7ca9bf19d9f220fe9/models.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-10000xx/CVE-2015-1000010.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0004","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000005","title":"Wordpress candidate-application-form 插件文件下载漏洞","description":"Wordpress candidate-application-form 插件 v1.0 中存在路径遍历漏洞。由于未能对用户上传的文件路径进行有效验证，攻击者可以利用不正常的目录遍历序列（如「../」）绕过安全限制，访问服务器上存储的任何敏感文件。攻击者只需发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求即可远程获取目标系统的配置文件、数据库文件、源代码及系统文件等敏感信息，严重威胁网站数据安全和系统完整性。该漏洞影响所有使用该插件的Wordpress网站，攻击无需认证即可执行，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000005"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:05.817","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:15.603","remediation":"该插件已于 2015 年 4 月 30 日从 WordPress 官方仓库下架，不再维护更新。建议立即删除 candidate-application-form 插件，或替换为其他仍在维护的候选人申请表单插件。如暂时无法删除，可在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面配置规则，阻止对 `/wp-content/plugins/candidate-application-form/downloadpdffile.php` 的访问请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/97108","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=142","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2015/1000xxx/CVE-2015-1000005.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000005_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-1000005-24202c6cbbdee45d1b59d8514a7fc240.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2015-1000005.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000005-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.md","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/CVE_Details/cve_details_introduction.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0668","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-7450","title":"IBM WebSphere 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere 等产品中的序列化对象接口因使用 Apache Commons Collections 库的 InvokerTransformer 类存在 Java 反序列化漏洞（CWE-502）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的序列化 Java 对象，利用该缺陷在服务器端执行任意命令，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 IBM 多款分析、商业解决方案、认知、IT 基础设施及移动和社交产品，攻击条件为攻击者能够访问 WebSphere 服务的相关接口并发送恶意序列化数据。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-7450"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-01-02T21:59:15.800","updated":"2026-06-17T00:32:33.670","remediation":"升级到 IBM WebSphere Application Server 8.5.5.8 或更高版本（传统部署），或 Liberty 17.0.0.4 修复包（8.5.5.0–8.5.5.9）。若无法立即升级，可应用 Interim Fix PI52103 作为临时缓解。删除 ${wlp.install.dir}/dev/tools/containers 目录下 com.ibm.ws.ejb.embeddableContainer_nls_8.5.0.jar 和 com.ibm.ws.jpa.thinclient_8.5.0.jar 这两个存在反序列化风险的 Apache Commons Collections jar 包，从 Liberty Fix Pack 17.0.0.4 或更新版本重新安装修复后的 jar。确认环境中未使用 jsf-2.0、jsf-2.2、jpa-2.0 这三个可选功能以降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21970575","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21971342","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21971376","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21971733","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21971758","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21972799","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/77653","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41613/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-7450","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41613","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7450.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2015/CVE-2015-7450.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3f4f82482490b6591dafca11546ed0ddb1b2a56b/2015/7xxx/CVE-2015-7450.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-7450/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-7450.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2015-7450.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2015-7450-259